@PaymentsModule_HostAddress = http://localhost:5150
@BearerToken = REEMPLAZAR_CON_TOKEN_JWT

### 1. Abrir turno de caja (201 Created / 409 Conflict si ya hay uno abierto)
POST {{PaymentsModule_HostAddress}}/api/v1/caja/abrir
Authorization: Bearer {{BearerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fondo_inicial": 500.00
}

### 2. Cerrar turno de caja (200 OK / 422 Unprocessable Entity si no hay turno abierto)
POST {{PaymentsModule_HostAddress}}/api/v1/caja/cerrar
Authorization: Bearer {{BearerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "efectivo_declarado": 2500.00
}

